abstract = {The present chapter provides summaries of the contributions to sustainability by selected disciplines which have not been devoted individual chapters. Overall, the summaries are meant to expand the perception of the enormous vastness of the scope of the sustainability endeavor, of the high variety of aspects involved, of the complexity of their relationships, and of the pervasive and necessary presence of multidisciplinarity. The summaries use human health and environmental health as the main leitmotif for the identification of multidisciplinary routes and networks.}
}

